            "text": "Education"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Modernize education for seamless admin, faculty, and student experiences."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Financial Services"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Accelerate financial platform adoption, reduce risk, adapt to changes."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Govt. & Public Sector"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Improve operational efficiency and elevate citizen experiences."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Healthcare"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Accelerate EHR workflows, eliminate user error risks, and simplify patient care."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Insurance"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Speed up claims, enhance portals, and reduce friction."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Life Sciences & Pharma"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Accelerate time-to-market, simplify GxP compliance, and unlock user productivity."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Don't see your industry?"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Improve operational efficiency and elevate citizen experiences."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Speak with Sales"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Whatfix Product Suite"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Whatfix Digital Adoption Platform"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Enable users with AI-powered in-app guidance, proactive user support, and on-demand assistance across web, desktop, and mobile applications. Explore Whatfix DAP"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Guide users through complex applications and processes with in-app Flows, Task Lists, Smart Tips, and Pop-Ups — powered by AI — to make your guidance smarter, faster, and more contextual."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Provide on-demand support to users, surfacing contextual answers from your existing knowledge sources using smart search and summarization without leaving an application."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Gather user engagement and workflow usage data on your in-app content. Analyze task completion, Flow dropoffs, Smart Tip views, common Self Help queries, and more."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Whatfix Product Analytics"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Unleash the full potential of your applications by analyzing engagement and making data-driven decisions that drive user adoption and product growth with our AI-powered insights. Explore Whatfix Product Analytics"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Set up custom user events to track without engineering dependencies, empowering application owners for internal applications and product teams for customer-facing apps."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "No need for deep analytics expertise. With Whatfix Product Analytics, uncover insights using a simple natural language conversational interface."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Capture behavioral insights, analyze them with Funnels and Journeys, and use them to improve product experiences within a single platform."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Whatfix Mirror"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Create interactive sandbox replicas of web applications to enable users with hands-on IT training without risking live software usage. Explore Whatfix Mirror"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Easily create interactive, hands-on replicas of any web application, without engineering dependencies. Enable users to practice real workflows in a risk-free environment, reducing costly mistakes and building proficiency faster."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Simulate real-world interactions and scenarios with AI Roleplay. Users build confidence, refine communication, and improve decision-making before engaging with actual customers in a risk-free setting."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Validate user readiness for real-world scenarios with interactive, role-based assessments. Measure knowledge retention post-training as users demonstrate new competencies and skills in adaptive evaluations tailored to their roles and content."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Trusted by Enterprises. Loved by Users."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Leader &amp; Customers’ Choice"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "DAP Category Leader with 500+ reviews"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Leader &amp; Highest Rated Vision &amp; Capability"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "users guided through 1,800 applications."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "faster time-to-value from digital investments."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "higher ROI on digital transformation projects."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Fortune 1000 use Whatfix to drive user adoption."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "99.9%"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "CSAT score"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "See why customers love Whatfix"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "“The problem with any system training is that it’s really hard to tailor training based on user roles. Training needs to be flexible. With Whatfix, you can instantly access information, rather than wait until a subject matter expert is available.”"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Nichola Holdship"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "People Development Manager"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&#8220;With a heavily customized Salesforce instance and multi-cultural processes, the flexibility of Whatfix empowers us to get the right training to the right people at the right time!&#8221;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Lee Glenn"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Senior Specialist, Global CRM Training Experian"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "“With Whatfix, we take a platform-by-platform approach to adoption benchmarks. The in-tool support and ability to quickly create content is a gamechanger.”"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Stephanie Dull"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Senior Director, Talent Development Strategies & Solutions Marriott International"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "“We were evaluating other DAP vendors, but the engagement with Whatfix was unreal; we just hit it off. The willingness of the people at Whatfix to come together and make it work was a difference-maker.”"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Hein Pieters"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Head of Adviser Solutions Old Mutual"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "“With Whatfix, we’ve completely shifted how onboarding and training works. We now have basic and domain-specific curriculum, Flows tailored to user roles, and embedded support that our teams genuinely appreciate. They often ask, ‘why don’t we have this on all of our digital tools?’”"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Alex Cooper"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Product Owner bioMérieux"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "“Before Whatfix, agents had to leave workflows to find help. Now they have everything at their fingertips. It’s about having people self-serve and deal with things themselves—that’s where we’ve seen real change.&#8221;"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h4",
            "text": "Mariella Gonzalez"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Director of Agency Support Windward Risk Managers"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Software Clicks Better With Whatfix"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See why Fortune 1000 enterprises and growth companies choose Whatfix as their digital adoption and user experience partner."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Software Clicks Better With Whatfix"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "&nbsp;"
          }
        ],
